<===> README.md
# Members of imported files

An imported file couldn't access variables and mixins of modules it loads
via `@use`, and members it forwards were exposed to the importer without
the prefix and show/hide filters of the `@forward` rule.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> forward_prefix/assign/input.scss
@import "p";
$p-a: 4;
a {b: $p-a}
<===> forward_prefix/assign/_p.scss
@forward "x" as p-*;
<===> forward_prefix/assign/_x.scss
$a: 0 !default;
@function fx() {@return fx}
@mixin mx {m: x}
<===> forward_prefix/assign/output.css
a {
  b: 4;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> forward_prefix/config/input.scss
$p-a: 5;
@import "pc";
<===> forward_prefix/config/_c.scss
$a: 0 !default;
b {c: $a}
<===> forward_prefix/config/_pc.scss
@forward "c" as p-*;
<===> forward_prefix/config/output.css
b {
  c: 5;
}
